{"speciesId":553,"names":{"fr":"Crocorible","es":"Krookodile","en":"Krookodile","ja":"ワルビアル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il ne laisse jamais échapper ses proies. Ses mâchoires surpuissantes peuvent broyer une voiture."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses yeux ont les mêmes propriétés que des jumelles et lui permettent de voir les objets très éloignés en agrandi."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can expand the focus of its eyes, enabling it to see objects in the far distance as if it were using binoculars."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon extrêmement violent qui broie tout ce qui lui passe sous les yeux avec ses mâchoires."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon bastante violento. Ataca todo lo que se mueva delante de él con sus mortíferas mandíbulas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"とても 凶暴な ポケモン。 目の前で 動くものは すべて 襲いかかり かみくだこうとする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il ne laisse jamais échapper ses proies. Ses mâchoires surpuissantes peuvent broyer une voiture."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Jamás deja escapar a su presa. Sus mandíbulas son capaces de destrozar la carrocería de un coche."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"出会った 獲物は 逃がさない。 自動車の ボディを 食いちぎる 強力な アゴを 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon extrêmement violent qui broie tout ce qui lui passe sous les yeux avec ses mâchoires."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon bastante violento. Ataca todo lo que se mueva delante de él con sus mortíferas mandíbulas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"とても 凶暴な ポケモン。 目の前で 動くものは すべて 襲いかかり かみくだこうとする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il ne laisse jamais échapper ses proies. Ses mâchoires surpuissantes peuvent broyer une voiture."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jamás deja escapar a su presa. Sus mandíbulas son capaces de destrozar la carrocería de un coche."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"出会った 獲物は 逃がさない。 自動車の ボディを 食いちぎる 強力な アゴを 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ses yeux perçants lui permettent de détecter une petite proie à 50 km, même au cœur d’une tempête de sable."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su vista es tan perspicaz que puede divisar presas de pequeño tamaño a 50 km de distancia, incluso en plena tormenta de arena."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its unique faculty of sight can detect small prey more than 30 miles away, even in the midst of a sandstorm."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"砂嵐でも ５０キロ先に いる 小さな 獲物も 発見する 特殊な 両目を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ses mâchoires sont si puissantes qu’il lui arrive de plier ou découper le corps de ses victimes sans même s’en rendre compte."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"En cuanto le hinca el diente a su presa con sus potentes mandíbulas, comienza a retorcerle el cuerpo hasta despedazarla."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"After clamping down with its powerful jaws, it twists its body around to rip its prey in half."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"強力な アゴで かみつくと そのまま 思い切り 身体を ひねり 獲物を 切断する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il peut repérer une proie à une distance de 50 km. Il s’approche alors en « nageant » dans le sable, puis lui saute dessus pour la croquer."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Al avistar una presa incluso a 50 km, repta hacia ella por la arena como si nadara y se abalanza para despedazarla con sus fauces."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When it spots prey, even at a distance of over 30 miles, it swims through the desert as if it were water, then jumps out and chomps them."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"５０キロ 先に いる 獲物を 見つけると 砂漠を 泳ぐように 移動して 飛びかかり 噛みつく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Lors des tempêtes de sable provoquées par Libégon, il se terre dans le sol, à l’affût d’une proie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se oculta en las tormentas de arena provocadas por Flygon y espera pacientemente al acecho de su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It conceals itself in sandstorms that Flygon whip up and waits patiently for prey to appear."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"フライゴンの 起こす 砂嵐に 身を 潜めて 獲物が くるのを じっと 待ちかまえている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il peut broyer d’épaisses plaques de fer d’un simple coup de mâchoire. On l’appelle le « tyran des sables »."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se lo conoce como el Terror de las Arenas. Con sus fuertes mandíbulas es capaz de destrozar a mordiscos una plancha de hierro fácilmente."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon is known as the Bully of the Sands. Krookodile’s mighty jaws can bite through heavy plates of iron with almost no effort at all."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"砂の ギャングとも 呼ばれる。 強力な 顎で ぶ厚い 鉄板も たやすく 食いちぎる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il aime la violence, mais sait aussi se montrer patient lorsqu’il doit passer plusieurs jours dans le sable à attendre une proie."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es de naturaleza violenta, pero también tiene la paciencia necesaria para esperar a su presa oculto en la arena durante varios días."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"While terribly aggressive, Krookodile also has the patience to stay hidden under sand for days, lying in wait for prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"凶暴だが 獲物の ために 砂の中で 何日も 待つ 忍耐強さも もっているぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":553,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",7],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",7],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",7],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[20,"level-up",51],[25,"level-up",51],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"ma